  "notes": "Built directly from the official Kent State University program page 'Plan of Study Grid' for Business Management - B.B.A. (2026-2027 content). Major Elective slots (9 credits total): BUS 30189/MGMT 44189 International Business/Management Experience, HRM 44183, HRM 44185, MGMT 34157, MGMT 34158, MGMT 34159, MGMT 34164, MGMT 34175, MGMT 34280, MGMT 44154, MGMT 44192. Mathematics or Critical Reasoning Elective (3 credits modeled): MATH 10051, MATH 11012, MATH 12002, or PHIL 21002. Progression requirements: minimum 2.000 overall GPA and minimum C grade in COMM 15000, ENG 21011, MATH 11010, and MGMT 24163. MGMT 44285 Strategic Management includes the Assurance of Learning Assessment. Prerequisite chain follows the program sequence: MATH 11010 -> math/critical-reasoning elective; ACCT 23020 -> ACCT 23021; BA 24056 -> BA 34156; MGMT 24163 -> upper-division MGMT leadership sequence -> MGMT 44285 capstone.",
